From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:53:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] BlueOS: Glimpse: Photo widgets 0.6.1

- Placed right away and set up by a tap (configuration_optional): the
  launcher dropped the widget when the setup came back after the photo
  picker.
- An 8 dp margin around the picture, like the other BlueOS widgets.

Change-Id: Ic6129785881746235ee32ea4f3d5079985c03746
---
